==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Grookey|11}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion; both cards have the Beat attack.
*'''Beat''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Falkner's Farfetch'd|3}} and {{TCG|VS|Karen's Magmar|88}}, both from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

